.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Describes one named field inside a custom Vulkan shader's fragment push-constant block, relative to the block's own start (0-based)\&. Sizes: float/int = 4, vec2 = 8, vec3 = 12, vec4/mat4's row = varies; use 64 for a full mat4\&. 
